WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.560
The September box office got a nice shot in
the arm thanks to the newest adaptation of

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.089
Stephen King's It.

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:10.660
Meanwhile, movie fans also got some exciting
new previews for what's to come in the near

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:11.660
future.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.289
From exciting thrillers to clever comedies,
here are the most promising trailers of the

00:00:15.289 --> 00:00:17.279
month of September.

00:00:17.279 --> 00:00:18.720
The Snowman

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.080
The Snowman already had one riveting preview,
but the international trailer offers even

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.849
more exciting glimpses at the mystery thriller.

00:00:25.849 --> 00:00:30.380
The film follows Harry Hole, a man tasked
with hunting down the elusive "Snowman Killer"

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.500
who leaves the childhood playthings as a way
to mark his victims.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.480
And thanks to this new autumn look at the
wintry movie, it's clear that the killer is

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:42.430
playing some serious mind games with everyone,
including reporting his next victim as missing

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:46.350
before he actually abducts her just to make
things even more grisly.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:51.030
This diabolical move proves the Snowman killer
is even more twisted than ordinary serial

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.030
murderers.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.160
Winter is about to come terrifyingly early
on October 20th when this movie lands in theaters.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.160
Tragedy Girls

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.600
Social media obsession gets taken to a deadly
new level in the trailer for the comedy thriller

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.600
Tragedy Girls.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:07.880
The movie features two teens who decide to
become crime reporters in an effort to boost

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.310
their social media influence.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:13.480
However, they quickly decide that the best
way to stay on top of the news is to create

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:14.480
it themselves.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:18.640
You know what comes next — the pair to murder
their classmates, kicking off with a big time

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.410
social media influencer.

00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:24.270
The girls take well to their newfound fame,
and they get more and more invested in their

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.520
killings and the likes that come along with
them.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:31.130
Count on this one to make you re-think your
digital game starting October 20th.

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:32.700
A Bad Moms Christmas

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:37.220
This sequel to Bad Moms will bring back our
trio of mothers as they take back the holidays

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:39.300
from the world's tough expectations.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.300
The one problem?

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.750
They'll also have to contend with their own
mothers, who've dropped in to spread some

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:44.750
Holiday jeers.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:45.750
"You are a mom.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.720
Moms don't have joy they give joy."

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:52.430
The trailer is full of dirty hijinks, including
a Santa Claus stripper, so prepare for some

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:54.500
naughty list-style fun this season.

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:58.680
A Bad Moms Christmas lands in theaters November
3rd.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:01:59.680
Thelma

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:03.740
The Norwegian supernatural thriller Thelma
centers on a new college student who comes

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:06.870
to discover she has supernatural powers she
can't explain.

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:10.739
That might seem like a nice alternative to
gaining the freshman fifteen, but from the

00:02:10.739 --> 00:02:15.019
looks of this trailer, those powers will become
terrifying rather than thrilling.

00:02:15.019 --> 00:02:19.569
This art house horror flick will hit theaters
on November 10th, just in time for a distraction

00:02:19.569 --> 00:02:20.569
from finals.

00:02:20.569 --> 00:02:21.599
Cook Off!

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:25.519
A movie many, many years in the making, Melissa
McCarthy's mockumentary Cook Off!

00:02:25.519 --> 00:02:31.180
was filmed way, way back in 2006, before the
actress broke out with her Academy Award-nominated

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:33.030
performance in Bridesmaids.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:37.510
With McCarthy's huge star power, the shelved
film was brought back from the dead and reportedly

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:38.560
re-edited.

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:42.879
Featuring McCarthy as one of the many competitors
in a cooking competition at a local hotel,

00:02:42.879 --> 00:02:48.120
the film promises lots of lunacy and delicious
treats when it finally hits theaters on November

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.409
17th.

00:02:49.409 --> 00:02:51.159
All the Money in the World

00:02:51.159 --> 00:02:55.140
Ridley Scott investigate one of the world's
most famous kidnappings in the first trailer

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:58.010
for his upcoming action drama All the Money
in the World.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:03.499
The movie follows the 1973 abduction of John
Paul Getty III, the grandson of the richest

00:03:03.499 --> 00:03:04.499
man in the world.

00:03:04.499 --> 00:03:08.530
The movie focuses on the desperate actions
that his mother Gail has to undergo in order

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:12.709
to get him back when her billionaire father-in-law
is unwilling to cough up the cash to get his

00:03:12.709 --> 00:03:13.709
grandson back.

00:03:13.709 --> 00:03:18.269
The real-life drama here is ripe for the pickings,
and it's exciting to see what Scott and his

00:03:18.269 --> 00:03:22.599
all-star cast will do with the story when
it lands in theaters December 8th.

00:03:22.599 --> 00:03:24.150
The Shape of Water

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:28.549
The first trailer for Guillermo del Toro's
The Shape of Water was exciting enough, but

00:03:28.549 --> 00:03:31.609
this new red band preview is even more incredible.

00:03:31.609 --> 00:03:36.219
This new glimpse of the otherworldly fairy
tale shows just how feisty Elisa will be while

00:03:36.219 --> 00:03:38.180
protecting the creature she loves.

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:41.951
Although she seemed stoic and innocent in
the first glimpse we saw of the movie, this

00:03:41.951 --> 00:03:46.569
new trailer proves Elisa isn't afraid to get
her hands dirty on behalf of her blue lagoon-style

00:03:46.569 --> 00:03:47.569
pal.

00:03:47.569 --> 00:03:51.049
Considering critics are already hailing this
film, it's clear The Shape of Water will be

00:03:51.049 --> 00:03:54.120
a must-see on its December 8th release.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.810
The Disaster Artist

00:03:55.810 --> 00:04:00.239
The first trailer for The Disaster Artist
focused on just one familiar moment from The

00:04:00.239 --> 00:04:01.239
Room.

00:04:01.239 --> 00:04:04.889
But this new teaser about the making of the
worst movie in the world further explores

00:04:04.889 --> 00:04:10.159
the relationship between Tommy Wiseau and
his co-star Greg Sestero, played by real-life

00:04:10.159 --> 00:04:13.120
brothers James and Dave Franco.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.489
"Stellaaaa"

00:04:14.489 --> 00:04:18.070
Count on this movie to be a lot better than
the one it's chronicling when The Disaster

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:22.110
Artist breaks into theaters on December 8th.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:25.130
Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:29.450
The new trailer for Jumanji: Welcome to the
Jungle proves that sometimes sequels might

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.340
not be such a terrible idea.

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:34.610
This new look at the film shows that none
of the characters in the new game will take

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:38.070
to their avatar characters very well in the
new virtual world.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:42.480
With some laugh out loud moments and a clever
reimagination of the original Jumanji, it

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:46.310
might just be worth it to roll the dice on
Welcome to the Jungle when it arrives on-screen

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:47.470
December 20th.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.620
"I hate this game.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.120
Everybody else got good stuff."

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.480
"Weakness, cake."

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:54.160
"yes cake is my weakness"

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.160
Downsizing

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:59.420
Matt Damon might be a huge star, but he's
hitting the small time for the upcoming comedy

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:00.420
Downsizing.

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:04.340
The film features him as a man who, alongside
his wife, decides to commit to a new procedure

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:07.500
that shrinks people down until they're five
inches tall.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:10.200
"Wow, that is wild isn't it?

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.200
Just wild."

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.350
Consider it a modern, satirical take on Honey
I Shrunk the Kids.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:18.420
Look for Downsizing to hit the big screen
on December 22nd.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:19.420
Red Sparrow

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:23.620
Jennifer Lawrence becomes a Russian femme
fatale in the upcoming action-thriller Red

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:24.620
Sparrow.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:28.590
She plays a ballerina who, after suffering
a career-ending injury, turns to espionage

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:33.390
for a Russian intelligence agency and uses
seduction, violence, and whatever other means

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:37.590
will be necessary to complete her missions
… that is, until she meets an American CIA

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:40.780
operative who might test her loyalty to the
Kremlin.

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:44.740
Considering today's political atmosphere,
this movie will probably be pretty timely

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.560
when it bows into theaters on March 2nd.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:49.090
Tomb Raider

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:53.560
Lara Croft has a new mission in the first
trailer for Alicia Vikander's upcoming Tomb

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.710
Raider reboot.

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:58.790
The film features the Oscar winner as the
adventurer as she sets off to find out what

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:03.280
happened to her father, who died while searching
for a tomb located on a mythical Japanese

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:04.280
island.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:07.690
The trailer hints that the film will draw
heavily from the 10th installment in the game

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:11.580
franchise, which offered up a more complex
take on the character than the releases that

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.060
inspired the Angelina Jolie-led movies.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:18.220
Look for Lara Croft to raid the box office
when the new movie lands in theaters on March

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:19.440
16th.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:20.440
Hostiles

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:24.950
Christian Bale takes a trip back in time for
the upcoming drama Hostiles, which features

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:29.580
him as an army captain tasked with bringing
a sick Cheyenne war chief and his family back

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.100
to their tribal lands in 1892.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:36.090
From the looks of this preview, Bale may be
putting forward another award-winning performance

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:40.300
in this period drama, so keep your calendar
open for when a release date is announced

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:42.320
for this historic film.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:43.320
The Lodgers

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:47.450
The haunted house genre gets a gothic twist
in the trailer for the upcoming horror flick

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:48.450
The Lodgers.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.830
The movie features two orphaned twins who
are forced to live in their parents' creepy

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.970
former home by a secret curse.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:58.110
When a young man who's in love with the sister
tries to free the pair, his actions set off

00:06:58.110 --> 00:07:00.470
a deadly and terrifying reaction.

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:04.930
With chilling visuals and mysteries aplenty,
this one is sure to draw out some scares when

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:06.250
it's released.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.250
Thanks for watching!

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.900
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.940
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

